// The last sentence of the limiting paragraph (unregulated-rate revenue counting as (A)/(D) income when the Secretary is satisfied)
// is the evaluative channel SecretarySatisfiedUnregulatedRatesAsFavourableAsRegulated; with no judgment the result stays NEITHER.
test "S7701-A33-11-SECRETARY-SATISFACTION-ON-UNREGULATED-RATES-REQUIRES-JUDGMENT" {
